  "solution": "Follow BODMAS rule to solve this question, as per the order given below, \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2f74e9e0034f2dd18b09af80953ba1e21d238d38ecff908df2f551116a31e61d.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n2.2 × 0.2 ÷ ( 0.4 × (1)/(2) ) - (1)/(2) × 4 (1.04 - 0.2 × 0.2)\n\n⇒ 2.2 × 0.2 ÷ (4/10 × 1/2) - 1/2 × 4(1.04 - 0.04)\n\n⇒ 2.2 × 0.2 ÷ (4/10 × 1/2) - 1/2 × 4 × 1\n\n⇒ 2.2 × 0.2 ÷ (4/10 × 1/2) - 2\n\n⇒ 2.2 × 0.2 ÷ (1/5) - 2\n\n⇒ 2.2 × 0.2 × 5 - 2\n\n⇒ 2.2 × 1 - 2\n\n⇒ 0.2\n\n**∴ **2.2 × 0.2 ÷ ( 0.4 × (1)/(2) ) - (1)/(2) × 4 (1.04 - 0.2 × 0.2)** = 0.2**\n\n6e:T64d,",
